{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "卿", "id": "卿"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "富", "id": "富"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "改", "id": "改"}, {"form": "攻", "id": "攻"}, {"form": "數", "id": "數"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "畔", "id": "畔"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}, {"form": "路", "id": "路"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}, {"form": "順", "id": "順"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.616818019731723, "source": "欲", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 3.8140425970679424, "source": "欲", "target": "富"}, {"weight": 2.1400661634962708, "source": "改", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 1.916922612182061, "source": "改", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.1400661634962708, "source": "改", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 3.120895416507997, "source": "親", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 2.833213344056216, "source": "親", "target": "攻"}, {"weight": 1.329135947279942, "source": "親", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.916922612182061, "source": "親", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.7346010553881064, "source": "親", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.833213344056216, "source": "過", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 3.0155349008501706, "source": "過", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.1400661634962708, "source": "過", "target": "順"}, {"weight": 2.833213344056216, "source": "過", "target": "數"}, {"weight": 2.0222831278398874, "source": "知", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.0222831278398874, "source": "知", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 2.427